  ],
  "abstract": "This paper describes a relationship between essentially \ufb01n ite groupoids and 2-vector spaces. In particular, we show to construct 2-v ector spaces of V ect-valued presheaves on such groupoids. W e de\ufb01ne 2-linear maps corre- sponding to functors between groupoids in both a covariant a nd contravariant way, which are ambidextrous adjoints. This is used to constr uct a representation\u2014 a weak functor\u2014from Span( FinGpd) (the bicategory of essentially \ufb01nite groupoids and spans of groupoids) into 2V ect. In this paper we prove this and give the construction in detail.",
